/Frameworks

# Bundled example score projects: their dependencies and nested VCS
# history stay out of this repository.
examples/*/node_modules/
examples/*/.git/

# Staged .pnds bundles of the built-in utility tools (npm run tools:fetch)
# and the download cache it keeps to skip re-fetching on rebuilds.
src-tauri/resources/builtin-tools/
.cache/
